{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_7_level_main_07-04_end","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"main_07-04","title":"並肩之約-2","storyCode":"7-5","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-04_end.txt","sourceHash":"7964e6dc99a618eaa7ac1522719c19e9886678ce9bf1f87eb1e94d54377c197a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"6:00am"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"消滅偵查部隊後，不會剩多少時間。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"正如你所說。時間緊迫。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"幹員不會從沙地扒到城上去。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......有些時候我們是會這麼做啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是核心城正在移動中，要想進入下層基礎結構，確實不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果幹員站在沙地上等著移動城邦駛過，無論是相對速度還是相對高度，都限制了幹員的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"沒辦法打開移動城邦底部的維修窗口與廢料出口的話，準備好的誘餌與隱蔽會失去意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我們的五支小隊會透過載具，以沙塵作為掩護接近核心城，最後利用工具登上核心城的底層工業結構。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"羅德島居然只派遣了五支小隊？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有急著想讓烏薩斯的地方將領捏到我們把柄的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"更不希望他們派出一艘高速軍艦，在荒原上摧毀我們的船艦，殺死我們的雇員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使事情這麼發生了，你也不會在任何一張報紙上看見證據。銀行家和保險業只會劃去你的名字，將所有的積累全部放進自己的保險庫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人會開口，因為烏薩斯不會希望有人開口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"中立身份意味著我們在夾縫中依然擁有些許的自由，相應的，羅德島不能擁有任何政治勢力作為後盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"隱蔽行事是我們的生存理念。派遣小隊去救你時，也是一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"五支小隊。留下痕跡、清除痕跡；目標完成、目標失敗。無論如何，羅德島最多只能派出五支小隊。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但更多小隊意味著更多的武裝力量！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"即使沒辦法解決問題？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是龍門這樣的城邦，想要消滅我們也是易如反掌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你也看見了，整個近衛局和比起各國頂級精英武裝也毫不遜色的特殊部隊，他們的實力遠不是一家醫藥公司能比的。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那為什麼我們要參與？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"因為這個陰謀已經捲入了感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，羅德島已經離開了龍門，以每小時十五公里的速度駛向下一個貿易城邦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"在這之前，我們可能會在荒野上停留數個星期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"除了靠近我們的羅德島通訊專員和可信任船隻，沒有人會收到我們的信號，我們會在各城邦的移動規劃中，挑選出避開所有人的路線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使龍門在事件過後反悔，他們也沒法再找到我們。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但這樣還不夠吧？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這一拳打上去不夠狠！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"還要更鋒利。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們的賭注應該不會只有這點。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。我們還需要額外的致命砝碼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士和凱爾希，都變得很陰沉可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我知道事情的必要性，你們也不用......露出那種笑容吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭......我笑了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道凱爾希醫生笑了啦。雖然你嘴唇不動，但我是能感受到笑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......真好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不，事先聲明，我沒有要和這個人修繕人際關係的意思。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"呵，我也沒這個意思。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"有無必要取決於雙方的自由意願。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這五支小隊，將分別由我、阿米婭與另外三位精英幹員帶領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"三支作戰小隊，一支偵察小隊，以及一支特殊作業小隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"其中，有一支作戰小隊的隊長，你也許該先見她一面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香！等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......煌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你傷得好重，怎麼還跑出來？快回去。快點回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你這次要出戰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我找人代替你。讓Misery去。他比你擅長攻堅戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"他一揮手就能解決的事，讓他去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想我去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"對，你不該去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"煌讓人感覺很奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"這和你以前的任務可不一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"因為可能會死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"說啥啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼能，怎麼......是怎麼這麼輕鬆地說出來啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你年紀太小了，這麼危險的任務，你是不該去的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"可阿米婭也要去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"因為她......！她是......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"她是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"她和我一樣，是感染者，也是幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我檢查了日誌。Ace和Scout都在切爾諾伯格，他們沒回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，他們已經不在了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去看看。我要明白是怎麼回事。我要看看管整合運動的人，我要知道是誰做了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我要知道在Ace和Scout身上發生了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香？這種事你......你可以不記的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......煌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"(粗口)，我他媽在說什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不，對不起，我不該這麼說。我不應該。**，我這張臭嘴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，他們的死......他們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"煌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"錯的是我。開心是記憶，傷心也是記憶。我的錯。你不能不記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"煌變得很奇怪。說的話也支離破碎的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不想你那麼痛苦。為什麼非要去回頭看它？如果是你的話......是可以把記憶放走的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以把它就放在那裡。讓它就躺在那裡，不要回頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不看......記憶又能用來做什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不看的話......就是忘記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會去忘掉的。我絕對不會忘記任何一個人的死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哈。對。你和我一樣。你也是羅德島的精英幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不能代你去，真的，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你又流血了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"小事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我送你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哎唷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"迷迭香......和阿米婭要好好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我會的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"很有必要嗎？見她一面......？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島雇傭的精英幹員們，都因為種種原因，將自身的精力和專業才能奉獻給了羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"他們帶領的小隊會全心全意地支持他們的工作，因為精英幹員在某些程度上，可以直接決定一種戰術的運用方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們並不都......符合我們的想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"精英幹員煌，博士你是見過的。有關煌的很多傳聞，可能博士都沒聽過，實際上，被幹員們添油加醋得有些厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在這一位精英幹員，所有人對她的印象都不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是博士，應該是能......慢慢地理解她和她的選擇的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的反應，也許你已經見過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那......那這樣就可以了嗎？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"還有什麼需要注意的？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"大致的安排就是這樣。事實上，唔......很現實的，計畫是計畫，行動是行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"只有行動才是重要的。計畫只是行動的雛形，而行動中的意外事件會打破一切計畫。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"希望我們沒人專做很糟糕的預言。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕.......很糟糕！有些不對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......沙塵的密度還是很稀疏，現在光線的角度，不大行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒在陰影裡！如果從艦橋觀察下來，我們可能會在開始全力運作前就完全暴露啦！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但已經不能再給機器添加外部遮蔽物了，一旦影響防塵器的空氣流通，產生的上升氣流，可能不足以保證沙塵浮動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦，要把位置繼續後移嗎......？可能會來不及！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......請交給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"守林人，請監測實際效果，告訴我接下來要調整的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"騎士？你要......做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"改變光線的角度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是為了減少這片大地上的苦難......我相信，連太陽的光芒，也願意為我一時頷首。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？沙丘那邊是誰？臨光嗎？她們不登車的還不撤退嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"她在幹什麼呢，沉思？擺造型......在這擺造型？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，好亮，她整個人開始發光了欸......不，等，糟了！太刺眼了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，謝謝隊長......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"如果隊長你的手指不是要把我的腦袋捏裂一樣扒得那麼緊的話，我會很感激你擋住了我的眼睛的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"臨光在做什麼啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"臨光沒問題？可......就算隊長你這麼說，這光也比陽光澈烈太多了，她要幹什麼啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎麼會......周邊的光芒好像被臨光漸漸同化了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，整個區域內的光，已經慢慢調諧成同一種感覺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道啊，我知道啦。我就是想說，你看，除了耀騎士，有誰能做到這種事呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，看看沙丘影子的投向，你猜現在是下午，還是上午？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我......就是活躍下氣氛。而且一會兒開始刮起沙塵，可就看不到影子囉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"我這就閉嘴。不好意思。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_aircraft"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"再高些！已經有奇怪顏色的球體劃過機身了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"教官，別怕，整合運動的術師沒有擊毀我們的本事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是做誘餌，不是要給整合運動表演飛行技術！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果我們做得很好的話，整合運動的人也會心悅誠服地投降吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那個叫什麼，武力展示？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"武力展示又不是叫你表演雜技......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"教官，抓好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"——嘔吐袋在哪？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"儀器已經完全啟動！阿米婭，車隊可以行動了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"各載具駕駛員，保持均速！依照圖示，利用沙塵的掩蔽接近核心城至可使用登城工具的距離！立刻行動！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_9"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"沙塵掩蓋住了我們載具的蹤跡，記得戴好防護用具，別讓沙塵進入精密器械！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但......陽光好清澈啊，為什麼陽光能穿透沙塵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"核心城底部的可見度似乎增加了，簡直是......法術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有......沒有這個安排吧？是自然光吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......先別管這麼多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！牽引裝置，準備發射！各幹員，優先確定滑索是否已經完全固定在核心城底部的牆面上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"所有幹員都完成轉移後，載具會立刻駛走！儘管我很少這麼說，但各位幹員，我想，現在的陽光，是我們會走好運的兆頭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......一定是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"（一不小心讓光芒變得太強烈了，只能往地面傾瀉這種事我怎麼說得出口......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，核心城似乎在加速？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"臨光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"即使整個裝置借助了風勢，也只能保證沙塵的潑灑涵蓋到一公里以內的範圍！一旦駛出範圍，他們必定會發現我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，動作快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"來不及了！我們必須立刻減速！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦駛出揚塵的範圍，切爾諾伯格核心城的光學觀察裝置可能會立刻捕捉到我們，潛入行動會因此失敗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你們還剩幾個隊員，都快......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"已經沒剩下隊員了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我自己來！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"（默默戴上防塵面具）","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"請將搭扣給我，我一個人上去。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......太危險了，博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有經過幹員訓練的人獨自登城，簡直離譜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生居然沒有給你安排戰場輔助人員嗎？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒有就沒有，還能怎麼樣呢？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"也許想鍛煉我的身體素質才刻意沒安排。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"有。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"？！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希一隻手環抱過你的腰部，將你拉上了滑索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，下次再自己把握命運吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_9"},{"type":"narration","text":"風沙很大，那隻“手”很堅硬，你有點不確定它是否屬於凱爾希。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_8"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"各個小隊，請各就各位！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來的行動，我們不能有任何失誤！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder"},{"type":"narration","text":"10:30 a.m.\n核心城地下基建"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，這個痕跡確實也是侵入的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"可以確定入侵者只有一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"前面的血跡，分不清是整合運動的還是誰的，血液還沒完全變性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"很可能就是陳警官......！我們必須加快速度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你安全抵達就好。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那也能叫安全......！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......很險。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"托某人的福，我可能差點就見不到你了。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"很，很危險嗎？Dr.{@nickname}，有沒有受傷？！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒事，走吧。只是心理創傷而已。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["羅德島幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜賓"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["臨光"]},{"speakerId":"char_158_milu","aliases":["守林人"]},{"speakerId":"char_401_elysm","aliases":["極境"]}]}
